# Images Directory

This directory is preserved for future local images.
Currently, the application uses placeholder images from Unsplash API.

Image URLs are defined in js/data.js using the format:
https://images.unsplash.com/photo-{id}?w=400&h=300&fit=crop

To use local images:
1. Place image files in this directory
2. Update the image paths in js/data.js
3. Ensure images are optimized for web (compressed, appropriate dimensions)
